    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85518" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-φραστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυφραδής</span>
			, <i>very wise,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Parm.
					1.4
				</span></i>
			; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δόλοι</span>”
				<i>shrewd,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					4.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μενοινὴ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					4.275
				</span></i>
			.</div>
